(footprint "SW_Kailh_Choc_V1V2_THT_Hybrid_2.00u_Vertical_ChocV2Stab" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Compatible with Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.3=13.95mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u vertical (1u wide x 2u tall, courtyard 19.00x38.05mm). Kailh Choc V2 stabilizer (CPG1353G24D01): PCB cutout slots (Edge.Cuts) and plate cuts on User.5 (overlapping outlines; union in plate CAD). Plate required. Rotated 90 deg for the vertical keycap (wire side at x=-8.28). For Choc V2 / Gateron KS-33 only (not Choc V1).")
  (tags "switch, low_profile")
  (attr through_hole)
